aders' Editor directly through the provided postal address in London, by email, or via the telephone number listed in the original notice.\n\nP.P.S This summary encapsulates the key corrections made by the editorial team.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Section", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -1.192093e-07}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.0002773789}, {"token": " Guardian", "logprob": -0.038691003}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.024632351}, {"token": " issued", "logprob": -0.0014315356}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0023671966}, {"token": " series", "logprob": -0.32416663}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " important", "logprob": -1.4058026}, {"token": " corrections", "logprob": -0.023254292}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.29517785}, {"token": " clarify", "logprob": -0.107893966}, {"token": " inaccur", "logprob": -0.540346}, {"token": "acies", "logprob": -8.3446537e-07}, {"token": " found", "logprob": -0.02573027}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -2.384186e-07}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.058488566}, {"token": " editions", "logprob": -4.324637}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.34212935}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.5776892}, {"token": " newspaper", "logprob": -0.023277475}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -1.0356456}, {"token": " These", "logprob": -0.013642622}, {"token": " amendments", "logprob": -0.4677804}, {"token": " address", "logprob": -0.0058577824}, {"token": " various", "logprob": -0.9573351}, {"token": " factual", "logprob": -0.0592224}, {"token": " errors", "logprob": -8.8215265e-06}, {"token": " ranging", "logprob": -0.09745465}, {"token": " from", "logprob": -2.384186e-07}, {"token": " legal", "logprob": -0.21173121}, {"token": " jurisdictions", "logprob": -0.057554793}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.18371902}, {"token": " corporate", "logprob": -0.02404086}, {"token": " titles", "logprob": -0.16206306}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " bi", "logpro